# Generated output that is compared byte for byte, and therefore must never be formatted.
#
# `pnpm css:check` recompiles the two corpora and compares them against what is recorded here, so a
# formatting pass that rewrites these files breaks the check for a reason that has nothing to do with the
# stylesheet. Measured: a repo-wide `prettier --write` reformatted `snapshot.css`, and the `css` stage failed
# on `@supports` wrapping and on `color: rgb(...)` becoming `color:rgb(...)`.
#
# These are output in the same sense `dist/` is — what the toolchain emits, not source. Most of the other
# generated paths in this repository are already covered by `.gitignore`, which Prettier honours, so only the
# tracked ones need to be named.
scripts/css-snapshot/snapshot.css
scripts/css-snapshot/structure.json
